#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-inverted-flight.rst:5
#: 2dcd297030b742f89126cfb19be0bb20
msgid "Inverted Flight"
msgstr "倒飞"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-inverted-flight.rst:7
#: 65bcd037c2b749c085b4de93c70f0397
msgid ""
"Since helicopters, including dual rotor and heli-quads, are capable of "
"generating negative thrust (negative collective) they have the capability of"
" flying, even hovering, inverted. This, of course, requires that the vehicle"
" is capable of generating sufficient thrust while inverted and is setup to "
"do so (see :ref:`traditional-helicopter-aerobatic-setup`)."
msgstr ""
"由于直升机，包括双旋翼和直升机四旋翼，能够产生负推力（负总距），因此具备倒飞甚至倒飞悬停的能力。这当然要求飞行器能够在倒置状态下产生足够的推力，并已进行相应设置（参见"
" :ref:`traditional-helicopter-aerobatic-setup`）。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-inverted-flight.rst:9
#: b21137315c6a4aad89b09c7caef1ca92
msgid "Inverted flight can be commanded in two different ways:"
msgstr "倒飞可以通过两种不同方式命令："

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-inverted-flight.rst:11
#: 559eb010485543088fb58b78077f2729
msgid ""
"Under pilot attitude control in ACRO mode which requires the pilot to push "
"the collective stick down to climb while inverted and the pitch control is "
"oriented to the inverted aircraft as well, or"
msgstr "在 Acro 模式下通过飞手姿态控制，要求飞手在倒飞时向下推总距摇杆爬升，俯仰控制也以倒置飞行器为方向；或者，"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-inverted-flight.rst:12
#: aea9816a338e44528d972cf801d1baad
msgid ""
"Under ArduPilot attitude stabilization control, in STABILIZE, ALTHOLD, "
"LOITER, and AUTO modes using the ``RCx_OPTION`` invert switch function "
"\"43\". This merely flips the effective orientation of the IMU to be "
"inverted and the vehicle follows. It will stabilise the vehicle with a roll "
"of 180 degrees from normal whenever inverted flight is enabled. While "
"inverted, collective is used normally in STABILIZE, ALTHOLD and LOITER where"
" pushing up on the collective causes the inverted helicopter to climb away "
"from the ground.  Pitch control is also used as though the aircraft is "
"upright."
msgstr ""
"在 ArduPilot 姿态稳定控制下，在 Stabilize、AltHold、Loiter 和 Auto 模式中，使用 ``RCx_OPTION`` "
"倒飞开关功能\"43\"。这仅翻转 IMU 的有效方向为倒置，飞行器随之跟随。启用倒飞时，飞行器将以正常状态 180 度横滚稳定。倒飞时，在 "
"Stabilize、AltHold 和 Loiter 中，总距照常使用，向上推总距使倒置的直升机爬高离地。俯仰控制也像飞行器正置时一样使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-inverted-flight.rst:15
#: a0ce1a13f2004dbbbb556e8596ab0236
msgid "Notes"
msgstr "注意事项"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-inverted-flight.rst:17
#: 0f515bad248a4c26ad52f9d36c7907fd
msgid ""
"GPS required modes such as LOITER and AUTO require good GPS performance "
"which may be impacted adversely if the GPS is facing down for long periods, "
"especially hover precision. Dual blended GPSes oriented such that one has a "
"\"sky-view\" while inverted can ameliorate this. In extreme cases, EKF "
"failsafes might occur with undesirable effects."
msgstr ""
"需要 GPS 的模式（如 Loiter 和 Auto）需要良好的 GPS 性能，如果 GPS "
"长时间朝下可能会受到不利影响，特别是悬停精度。朝向不同的双路混合 "
"GPS（其中一路在倒飞时有\"天空视野\"）可以改善此问题。在极端情况下，可能会发生带有不良影响的 EKF 失控保护。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-inverted-flight.rst:18
#: b8b101a1d85048798cad5566e0ed37ea
msgid ""
"Negative collective range is not impacted using the invert switch, ie it "
"becomes the effective climb control so be sure there is sufficient range."
msgstr "使用倒飞开关不影响负总距范围，即它成为有效的爬升控制，因此请确保有足够的范围。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-inverted-flight.rst:21
#: acfefc71919a4e60b119e069ab737895
msgid "Setup of the inverted flight feature"
msgstr "倒飞功能设置"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-inverted-flight.rst:23
#: ac0a85d3258445d2a7b3b3a254505aad
msgid ""
"The inverted flight feature is initiated by setting an RC channel via "
"RCx_OPTION parameter.  The RCx_OPTION parameter allows you to configure a "
"transmitter switch to enable inverted flight for helicopters. To enable it, "
"choose a RC input channel which is not being used for anything else, and "
"setup your transmitter to give a PWM value larger than 1750 when a "
"previously unused 2 position switch is enabled, and a value below 1200 when "
"it is not enabled.  For example, if channel 7 is currently unused, and you "
"set :ref:`RC7_OPTION<RC7_OPTION>` to InvertedFlight (which has value 43) "
"then if your transmitter sends 1900 on channel 7 the helicopter will flip "
"upside down and continue flying in whatever mode it is in, but with the "
"helicopter inverted."
msgstr ""
"倒飞功能通过 RCx_OPTION 参数设置 RC 通道来启动。RCx_OPTION "
"参数允许您配置发射机开关以为直升机启用倒飞。要启用它，选择一个未用于其他用途的 RC 输入通道，并设置您的发射机，使之前未使用的 2 "
"位开关启用时给出大于 1750 的 PWM 值，不启用时低于 1200。例如，如果通道 7 当前未使用，并将 "
":ref:`RC7_OPTION<RC7_OPTION>` 设为 InvertedFlight（值为 43），那么当您的发射机在通道 7 上发送 "
"1900 时，直升机将翻转到倒置位置，并继续以当前模式飞行，但直升机倒置。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-inverted-flight.rst:25
#: ce36096df3bb45abbd380af5b812ff72
msgid ""
"Be sure to setup pitch and roll rate limits.  This will keep the attitude "
"controller from commanding unachievable roll or pitch rates.  It is "
"recommended in STABILIZE or ACRO that you command max roll and pitch rates."
"  Pull the flight logs and determine what is the maximum pitch and roll rate"
" the aircraft can achieve.  Then set :ref:`ATC_RATE_R_MAX<ATC_RATE_R_MAX>` "
"for max roll rate and :ref:`ATC_RATE_P_MAX<ATC_RATE_P_MAX>` for max pitch "
"rate.  If you are unable to determine the max rates then be conservative and"
" set them to 120 deg/s initially."
msgstr ""
"务必设置俯仰和横滚速率限制。这将使姿态控制器不会命令无法实现的横滚或俯仰速率。建议在 Stabilize 或 Acro "
"模式下命令最大横滚和俯仰速率。查看飞行日志，确定飞行器可以达到的最大俯仰和横滚速率。然后设置 "
":ref:`ATC_RATE_R_MAX<ATC_RATE_R_MAX>` "
"为最大横滚速率，:ref:`ATC_RATE_P_MAX<ATC_RATE_P_MAX>` 为最大俯仰速率。如果无法确定最大速率，则保守地初始设置为 "
"120 deg/s。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-inverted-flight.rst:28
#: a93bdd3d881c45e39879a0336c1f83a2
msgid "Tips"
msgstr "技巧"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-inverted-flight.rst:30
#: 532888716ad94710a1e9da65a8269905
msgid "Here are some general tips about inverted flight"
msgstr "以下是一些关于倒飞的一般技巧"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-inverted-flight.rst:32
#: b16083493f47458aabc2a49692aeef43
msgid ""
"Try it out in simulation first to get used to it, and ensure your "
"transmitter is setup right."
msgstr "先在仿真中尝试以熟悉操作，并确保您的发射机设置正确。"

#: ../../source/docs/traditional-helicopter-inverted-flight.rst:34
#: 776c3a38db754c1596bd8ae7ee207883
msgid ""
"make sure you have plenty of height before engaging or disengaging inverted "
"flight for the first time. The aircraft should not lose much altitude during"
" the transition but it is worth having the extra altitude in case something "
"unexpected happens.  As you get more comfortable in the aircraft's ability "
"to transition from upright to inverted and vice-versa, then you can lower "
"the altitude where the transition is made."
msgstr ""
"首次进入或退出倒飞之前，请确保有足够的高度。飞行器在转换期间不应损失太多高度，但预留额外高度以防意外情况发生仍是值得的。随着您对飞行器从正飞转换到倒飞（及反向）能力的信心增强，可以逐步降低进行转换的高度。"
